      "blocked_on": [
        {
          "surface": "README.md",
          "claim": "produce verifiable evidence that a given governance configuration actually enforces what it claims",
          "why": "The evidence establishes which configuration was present and that it did not change. It does not establish that the configuration was causally responsible for any decision: the same verdicts are produced under every domain pack. Three honest forms are set out in the register; the choice is public copy."
