        {
          "surface": "GitHub repository About description",
          "claim": "Blocks policy-breaking requests. Signed, offline-verifiable audits for regulated/insurable AI.",
          "why": "The policy-shaped input changes no verdict, and nothing supports the insurance half: the gate carries no actor, user, session or principal field and observes neither model output nor downstream action. Replacement wording required."
