        {
          "surface": "structuraldesignlabs.com homepage",
          "claim": "the uncovered-row claim",
          "why": "The list of uncovered rows is generated by calling the gate's own rule function, so the agreement is one function evaluated twice rather than the independent confirmation the page implies. Qualify it or lead with the disclosure."
