      ],
      "note": "The register is built, linked from the README and held by tests: every claim carries a status, cites something a reader can check, and records whether the feature sits inside the filed specification. Four figures are compared against the measurements that produced them, so the register cannot drift from the archive, the threat model or the workload tool. The item stays open because the condition is about the claims and not about the register: three public surfaces still carry claims the register itself records as not surviving examination, and the replacement wording is the founder's to write. Those three are listed in blocked_on."
